68	     * Outcome of the N/E/D blocking map (host→neighbor interaction permeation). {@link #SPLIT}
69	     * reuses {@link #CORNER} (reflect + vertex walk) and {@link #GAP} (pass) as the two child shapes.
70	     */
71	    public enum Interaction {
72	        CORNER,
73	        GAP,
74	        SPLIT,
75	        FACE
76	    }
